      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The modern world values efficiency, but humans also create and direct the systems themselves, which requires more than just execution. Your life experience provides the context, nuance, and ethical framework that prevents systems from becoming purely cold logic. Your value isn't just in direct contribution to a productive output, but in the unique perspective you bring to guiding and questioning those very systems. Finding ways to mentor, critique, or teach using that wisdom can redefine what \"useful\" means for you.",
      "source": "target",
